<LegalLayout title="Legal Notice" description="Who operates Brev, its current service status, infrastructure and reporting contacts.">
<h2>1. Who runs Brev</h2>
  <p>Brev is a personal project operated by <strong>Matteo Genovese, an individual based in Italy</strong>, who is also the data controller.</p>
  <p>Privacy contact: <a href="mailto:privacy@brevl.ink">privacy@brevl.ink</a>. Abuse contact: <a href="mailto:abuse@brevl.ink">abuse@brevl.ink</a>.</p>
  <p>No data protection officer has been appointed.</p>

  <h2>2. Service status</h2>
  <p>Brev Cloud is live at <a href="https://brevl.ink">brevl.ink</a> and is free of charge. There are no active paid plans or payment flows. For this reason, no VAT number is published. It will be published before any paid service is offered.</p>

  <h2>3. Infrastructure</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>IONOS SE, Germany:</strong> application and database hosting.</li>
    <li><strong>Cloudflare, Inc.:</strong> CDN, DNS and TLS termination for the website and customer domains, plus WAF and Cloudflare for SaaS.</li>
    <li><strong>Contabo GmbH, Germany:</strong> hosting of the transactional mail server <code>mail.novezero.it</code>.</li>
    <li><strong>Plausible self-hosted:</strong> public-site statistics on the controller's infrastructure at novezero.it.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Software and licence</h2>
  <p>The public repository is <a href="https://github.com/brevlink/brev">brevlink/brev</a>. The software uses the <a href="https://github.com/brevlink/brev/blob/main/LICENSE">MIT licence</a>. Brand use follows <a href="https://github.com/brevlink/brev/blob/main/TRADEMARK.md">TRADEMARK.md</a>.</p>
  <p>The author link to <a href="https://matteogenovese.com">Matteo Genovese</a> is an attribution. That reference alone does not confer a supplier or representative role. The operator and controller are identified above.</p>

  <h2>5. Reporting</h2>
  <p>Report abuse to <a href="mailto:abuse@brevl.ink">abuse@brevl.ink</a> or through <a href="/app/report">Report a link</a>. Report security issues through <a href="https://github.com/brevlink/brev/security/advisories/new">GitHub Security Advisories</a>. Send privacy requests to <a href="mailto:privacy@brevl.ink">privacy@brevl.ink</a>.</p>

  <h2>6. Related documents</h2>
  <p>Read the <a href="/privacy">Privacy Notice</a>, <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>, <a href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a> and <a href="/subprocessors">Subprocessors and Retention</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
